WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.448
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind finding keyboard keys.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.555
Space bar: leaves a gap between words. Enter key: moves to the next line or confirms

00:00:11.555 --> 00:00:12.214
a choice.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.537
Backspace: deletes the character before the cursor. Shift key: makes capital letters

00:00:17.537 --> 00:00:21.289
when held. Number keys: type the digits zero to nine.

00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:27.023
With an adult supervising, practise space bar and enter key using a computer if one

00:00:27.023 --> 00:00:31.930
is available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each step to a partner.
